{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_119_synopsis", "source_sha256": "58a5e46ff90c50463b2c92548ce265568ea2a0839e4ab38afefaeb913b971628", "ja": "大好きな小説をプレゼンしている百合子に、\nその小説が映画化、主題歌を歌ってほしいと\nいうオファーが届く。百合子は戸惑うが、\nプロットを読み、制作陣の思いに触れた事で\n自らも初心を思い出し、参加を決意する。", "zh": "百合子正在介绍自己最喜欢的小说，\n这时收到了一份邀约——那部小说要拍成电影，\n希望由她来演唱主题曲。百合子虽感到困惑，\n但在读过故事大纲、体会到制作阵容的心意后，\n自己也回忆起了初心，决意参与其中。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_119_1000_null", "source_sha256": "ac481c7f2b0b97ac0eb792099bda7cfbb75250f0e635b4f4519ba1250f053cf9", "ja": "数日後、百合子の部屋……", "zh": "数日后，百合子的房间……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_119_1001_026yur", "source_sha256": "49ddc772221d6bc129cb5558a0d8385dbac484bb053322229d606f421b1a0d89", "ja": "……国産ファンタジーの金字塔『星風の守護者』\n待望の映画化決定！　詳細は続報にて……。", "zh": "……国产奇幻里程碑之作《星风守护者》\n万众期待的电影化正式决定！详情请见后续报道……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_119_1002_026yur", "source_sha256": "456cef82afb69d24f1b662fe2de4275f2840b0d0eda00a4eb63ffebdcd5cd27d", "ja": "映画化、もう発表になったんだ……。\nコメントの反応、どんな感じだろう……。", "zh": "电影化的消息，已经公布了啊……\n评论区的反应，不知道怎么样呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_119_1003_null", "source_sha256": "9f53e086a4e78bf5bbe40a8d830ce36d3a8003f5938ebad6cba45607ec0a9fe1", "ja": "「嬉しい！！！」「何年も待ってた！」\n「アニメで会えるのが今から楽しみ～♪」", "zh": "“太开心了！！！”“等了这么多年！”\n“现在就已经好期待在动画里相见了～♪”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_119_1004_026yur", "source_sha256": "43a521a33e2f61092c6663dfe32ea6bb409fc04cefca645bbbfa47a63feb503e", "ja": "けっこう好評、なのかな……？\n他にはどんな反応があるんだろう……。", "zh": "反响还不错，应该是吧……？\n不知道其他人都是什么反应……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_119_1005_null", "source_sha256": "86cb7f0068eabe95a0d2e99f76ea8b17fc6f66eac6d037f29b0dc3d18e2b6fec", "ja": "「原作勢としては鏡の城が不安かな？\n長らく映像化されなかった原因だと思うし」", "zh": "「作为原作党，可能还是会担心镜之城吧？\n毕竟我觉得那也是长期未能影视化的原因所在」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_119_1006_026yur", "source_sha256": "1b0b2b99065935b00b3ca8394503af82fd0737d30f653a8defea5689858c106b", "ja": "わ、わかる……！\n不安になるのはやっぱりそこで……。", "zh": "太、太懂了……！\n让人担心的果然就是那里……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_119_1007_null", "source_sha256": "234101710a43308363c1c12ceb261da60a4fb79cb8e67126bc8c2308ebb3d64b", "ja": "「映画化は嬉しいけど、原作が大好きだから\nイメージが崩れないといいな……」", "zh": "「虽然拍成电影很高兴，但我太喜欢原作了，\n要是形象没有幻灭就好了……」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_119_1008_026yur", "source_sha256": "b2bdc939e777ec2db03300ab256360242f4136c42f23b6eafbb3e282ac89fe85", "ja": "うっ……原作好きな人ほど……。\nそっかぁ……でも、そうだよね……。", "zh": "呜……越是喜欢原作的人，就越是……  \n这样啊……不过，确实是这样呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_119_1009_026yur", "source_sha256": "4375386dd6737200732db3deb863e28917526b08db1aa81b01ad3146330e9d1a", "ja": "わかるよ……私も、大好きだもん……。\n……その上、主題歌が……わ、私だなんて……。", "zh": "我很理解的……毕竟我也最喜欢这部作品了……\n……而且，主题曲居然……由、由我来唱……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
