{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_119_1014_p", "source_sha256": "ad9249b495888a3a187156246f930aa663d4f0ab7bc54588805ca72eeb0d81ba", "ja": "だ、大丈夫か百合子！？\nかなり派手に転んだけど……。", "zh": "百合子，没事吧！？\n摔得可真够狼狈的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_119_1015_026yur", "source_sha256": "3095d1394aff2c2945d6f8c9cf2a7e17676a370efbbe4705725dbeed7a1ab51f", "ja": "だ、大丈夫れす……。うう、寝不足で遅刻して、\nレッスンもこんな調子で……すみません……。", "zh": "没、没事……呜呜，因为睡眠不足迟到了，连训练也变成这样……对不起……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_119_1016_048rei", "source_sha256": "641b95acc1e299190adad36a496962865cbad1d23002514d56f680fd240c5c3c", "ja": "全力で絶不調、って感じだね？\nそういう日は無理しないで、休憩多めでいこう？", "zh": "感觉像是拼尽全力地状态糟糕透顶呢？\n这种日子就别勉强自己，多休息几次吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_119_1017_026yur", "source_sha256": "846ffe3b063b552e0ab641937e78ac3bf56c0a60b6c6fdb09e7b92f0c52cc0d3", "ja": "ふぁい……。\nありがとうございます……。", "zh": "我……尽力了……。\n谢谢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_119_1018_017kth", "source_sha256": "9efbd2b323a9d7744816fad662fdc6a35bcbc70b545d11b81c0b756a6a13f2a5", "ja": "百合子ちゃん、映画化が発表になってから\n特に悩みがひどくなったみたいだね……。", "zh": "百合子，自从宣布要拍成电影后，她好像就变得特别烦恼了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_119_1019_046rio", "source_sha256": "9f5d5576e3d8badf49b28c829dcf81b5507a49cb19d8a3617258681b6ee0857f", "ja": "睡眠はきちんととらなきゃダメよ？\n美容もそうだけど、なにより健康のためにね。", "zh": "睡眠可一定要好好保证哦？\n美容固然重要，但最重要的还是为了健康。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_119_1020_026yur", "source_sha256": "9421b7463e1dcf63c8a761c4399f343d807bbcd632a6a63e3981318b185f6fe8", "ja": "わかってはいるんですけど……ファンの人たちの\nいろんな反応を見て、ついつい考え込んでしまって……", "zh": "我明白这个道理，可是……看到粉丝们的各种反应，就不由得陷入了沉思……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_119_1021_p", "source_sha256": "5acdd30b8d43dc45da70b1bd2105fadb763c7885b0dbb06c10ebe658ae4bd4bf", "ja": "反応が気になるのは仕方がない。\nでも、ほどほどにしておかないと。", "zh": "会在意反应也是没办法的事。\n不过，也不能太过在意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_119_1022_p", "source_sha256": "f7c0fa9f5203dd611c15f9d30f09d489ac26c5be2b753107fe54724b8c01024b", "ja": "人気作品だからこそ、感想も膨大な数になる。\n全てを気にしていたら、振り回されてしまうからな。", "zh": "正因为是热门作品，评论也多得惊人。要是每条都在意，可就会被牵着鼻子走了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_119_1023_026yur", "source_sha256": "1bdbeeb461854fbd53824999dd2d123087b441ebb96cbb47e4ef4d487d5b4ee2", "ja": "そうですね……。\nよし、今夜からはネットを絶って……！", "zh": "是啊……。好，从今晚开始就断网……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_119_1024_026yur", "source_sha256": "1338b7a485962e76722de4a96300a3cad82933d6be1823af60a2ac823a30bb77", "ja": "あっ、でもそうなると新刊の感想を漁れなく\nなっちゃう！？　そ、それは困るかも……。", "zh": "啊，不过那样的话，就没法搜罗新刊的感想了！？那、那可有点麻烦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_119_1025_003mik", "source_sha256": "4fd05cfcdfe8b72bd9779aa8943480c0100c2a015a53e03f67eb4ffa43c8d9e6", "ja": "百合子は、他の人の感想を読むのが好きなの？", "zh": "百合子喜欢看别人的感想吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_119_1026_026yur", "source_sha256": "54f8c404ed9a5c3633f79ebb18593d2e247c315600fdc120c58a432fd91e07d7", "ja": "はい！　自分とは違う視点での感想や、\n深い考察を読むのは、とっても面白いので……。", "zh": "是的！阅读和自己不同视角的感想，以及深入的分析，非常有意思……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_119_1027_003mik", "source_sha256": "42a480e0466cca53abf0c4538ab6173ea45c31cf83792e1b4c1619d9f7646599", "ja": "そっか。\nなら、ミキが本の感想言ってあげようか？", "zh": "这样啊。\n那要不要美希说说对这本书的感想？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_119_1028_026yur", "source_sha256": "b2d8cbdeae2d3dbf77ce7386a3bc6a16d24f45974444ea1098642d142d37b5a1", "ja": "美希さんが本の感想……えっ！？\nまさか……読んでくれたんですか？", "zh": "美希小姐要说读后感……诶！？\n难道说……您读过了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_119_1029_003mik", "source_sha256": "f6f9d2f340e4f7948fe5aefff437620738d390b95eb95d42aef7cb11a9c3f0e6", "ja": "うん。\n百合子が言うから、一巻だけ。", "zh": "嗯。\n因为百合子都那么说了，就看了一卷。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_119_1030_048rei", "source_sha256": "35ccaa9e3c7538b24afd35d1e9e2c06c20da51a5efaac349e48859e918b80ad0", "ja": "はいはーい、私も読みました♪\nここにいるみんな、読んだよね？", "zh": "好啦好啦，我也看过了♪\n在场的大家都看过了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_119_1031_046rio", "source_sha256": "c99a5da660daed5be8c9d0a173f0aa3477f549decec06fcc0ca7b9805d83bf1c", "ja": "ええ、百合子ちゃんのコラムをきっかけに。\nとはいえ、私も一巻だけだけど……。", "zh": "对，是以百合子的小专栏为契机。不过我也只看了一卷……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_119_1032_017kth", "source_sha256": "38192646f30191f92b6e935cacd3f63b50c06eb09e1f0471b1852ec1dda77c71", "ja": "私は一応、全巻。もし正式なお仕事になった時、\nその方がスムーズかと思って。", "zh": "我姑且把全套都看完了。想着要是正式接下这份工作，那样应该会更顺利些。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_119_1033_p", "source_sha256": "7f85806b17e4f964987a5bb6abb16128de87cffc42c0faed258e0d49fb244089", "ja": "みんな熱心だな……。いや、百合子が\n熱弁をふるったおかげというべきか……。", "zh": "大家都很认真啊……不，应该说是多亏了百合子慷慨激昂地说服了大家吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_119_1034_026yur", "source_sha256": "2bf4b2178892b04dcb92a1123e92426491c98f5a45f9103f958afa519ef06f7d", "ja": "みなさん……！　ぜひ感想をお聞きしたいです！\n『星風の守護者』、どうでしたかっ！？", "zh": "大家……！请务必告诉我你们的感想！\n《星风的守护者》怎么样！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_119_1035_003mik", "source_sha256": "124205e1c5db2ee35cbe521f45df29ed7c9be8830dd282b262a1f3007af1a3c9", "ja": "けっこう、面白かったかも？\n読みやすかったし。", "zh": "好像还挺有意思的？\n读起来也很轻松。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_119_1036_026yur", "source_sha256": "859295657cd3775c01eedadba9fd269289e302e5ba66f2f10b5f90bc6fe3ba85", "ja": "……。\nそ、それで……感想のほうは……？", "zh": "……。\n那、那个……读后感怎么样呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_119_1037_003mik", "source_sha256": "255c2438485356ede1c190f280a9b0e6dfd066de1a200c76b5b208e1b54a1ccb", "ja": "？　今のが感想だよ。", "zh": "嗯？刚才那就是感想啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_119_1038_026yur", "source_sha256": "6b0b06bb649ca7b8cacf8a6411fec656c634368ad196be6b695952185d72b835", "ja": "いやっ！？　なんていうか、気に入った登場人物とか、\nこの展開がよかったーとか、そういうのは……。", "zh": "不是啦！？该怎么说呢，比如喜欢的登场角色，\n或者觉得哪个发展很棒之类的，就没有这种感想吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_119_1039_003mik", "source_sha256": "665f37ff62ce9eee7462ba307ac3bae7d5857c0ee4e3a18652d51f2a1401e9e7", "ja": "んー、名前は覚えてないの。\nでも読んでる時は、なんか面白いなーって思ってたよ。", "zh": "嗯——我没记住名字。\n不过读的时候，就觉得还挺有意思的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_119_1040_026yur", "source_sha256": "0e10faa86b03602a9726fb083364b5175f478e46bf251e2784909d90fef165c1", "ja": "なんか面白い……。でも、それで最後まで\n読めてしまうのは、やはり名作の証拠……？", "zh": "总觉得挺有意思的……不过，能这样读到最后，果然就是名作的证明……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_119_1041_046rio", "source_sha256": "e046e563972ff500f87ae6c45d654e969fff3a61fc314564d720d288c507db9a", "ja": "それじゃあ次は私ね！　私はね、主人公たちが\n三角関係っぽくなるところがよかったと思うわ！", "zh": "那么接下来该我了！我觉得主角们之间变得像三角关系的那段很不错！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_119_1042_026yur", "source_sha256": "253297d924bb96d2a3e69632ba1aafac0bb953b988b9a65a50319c68747987dd", "ja": "あ、森で迷っちゃうところですね。\n妖精のヤキモチがかわいくって。", "zh": "啊，是在森林里迷路的那一段吧。\n精灵吃醋的样子特别可爱。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_119_1043_046rio", "source_sha256": "8886e11352ba78eeadba5b272c92476454ef5f9d67136e0ecafbc5545220dc0a", "ja": "そうなの！　もっとドギマギさせてほしかったな～。\nあそこだけで一冊読みたいくらい！", "zh": "就是嘛！真想让人再心慌意乱一点呢～。\n光是那一段，我都想单独读一整本了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_119_1044_026yur", "source_sha256": "e1de51ef14afc524c11115a32ba2191758e4b2af43b0b7e250b80dfb61633b5f", "ja": "そ、そうなると冒険ファンタジーではなく\n恋愛モノになってしまう気が……。", "zh": "这、这样一来感觉就不是冒险奇幻，而是变成恋爱题材了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_119_1045_026yur", "source_sha256": "840b9d91304068eb4bb06713959b9e7bc992572c74dbdacc73829c94744a5967", "ja": "みなさん、着眼点が独特ですね……。\n確かに新鮮な感想ではあるんですけど……。", "zh": "大家的切入点还真是独特呢……\n虽然这种感想确实很新鲜就是了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_119_1046_017kth", "source_sha256": "f5e26d731e7d110fc8b4d940997249e1101f9a9065651d69a55cdb525f8fd6fd", "ja": "わ、私は、アクションが爽快だと思ったよ！\n特に鏡のお城は、心理描写ともマッチしてて……。", "zh": "我、我觉得动作戏很爽快哦！\n特别是镜子城堡那段，和心理描写也很契合……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_119_1047_026yur", "source_sha256": "ddd5c1b4f38d0388ff89e19b9ba057659882f6b67b2c48aa446ebd99e7a16e87", "ja": "で、ですよね！？\nあそこは原作ファンからの人気も高いんです！", "zh": "对、对吧！？\n那里在原作粉丝中人气也很高！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_119_1048_048rei", "source_sha256": "fb9c2ea3dd468d98aa100fec8009dc6fb889216d987260d447486c9e51955d15", "ja": "私も面白かったよ！\n夢中になって一晩で読んじゃったくらい♪", "zh": "我也觉得很有意思！\n看得入迷，甚至一晚上就读完了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_119_1049_026yur", "source_sha256": "433ab988fc5e9731d00fd4d58183149f30a6d7068b35d2d99a51c9ec1a60168a", "ja": "わあ、すごく嬉しいです！\n麗花さん的には、どうでしたか……？", "zh": "哇，太让我高兴了！\n在丽花小姐看来，觉得怎么样呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_119_1050_048rei", "source_sha256": "8bd3ffd792e9203a18b181071f0d05ed5fc4e54c4f2e96239771b2abeb8deb0b", "ja": "読み終わったあと、\nなんだか胸がきゅーってなって……。", "zh": "读完之后，\n心里莫名地揪了一下……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_119_1051_048rei", "source_sha256": "8acb7f3eb15216dde690672721e80cb1727146e09194329bc5dd69453aaafc55", "ja": "お味噌汁飲みたくなっちゃった。\nわかめと油揚げのやつ！", "zh": "不知不觉就想喝味噌汤了。\n要海带芽和油豆腐的那种！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_119_1052_026yur", "source_sha256": "2f061101e45e47f2513b2ddd04df6c708cb3cf1a554b1321fdd4ba3ea4acb034", "ja": "{$P$}さん……\n私はもう、何もわからなくなりました……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……\n我已经什么都搞不明白了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_119_1053_026yur", "source_sha256": "dc2e0ca6b0fc915080d06a65582d0c0b872b25081d1c22d790a1c00db5667f6d", "ja": "私は、本当はあの小説のことを、\n何もわかっていなかったのでは……？", "zh": "难道其实我根本就不了解那部小说吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_119_1054_026yur", "source_sha256": "3622d7047c12d3599b40aca55d951c8196ee5ccbde91482c6cc2a43b05fd807f", "ja": "こんな私が映画の主題歌なんて……。\nとうてい無理なんじゃ……。", "zh": "像我这样的人，怎么可能唱电影主题曲……。\n恐怕根本做不到吧……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_119_1055_p", "source_sha256": "b07e2dd38f88c60ea1c01706545021ca0641d964f9551fd77b1f9483bd6c98c9", "ja": "落ち着け、百合子。結論を出すのは、この資料に\n目を通してからでもいいんじゃないか？", "zh": "冷静下来，百合子。下结论的事，等看完这份资料再说不也行吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_119_1056_026yur", "source_sha256": "d77759fdd82de72cf0b290cfaed8722afb38013a4f945745e8e3d178edaadfb6", "ja": "これは……脚本の……ぷ、プロット！！？\nい、いいんですか？　正式に受ける前なのに……。", "zh": "这是……剧本的……大、故事梗概！？  \n这、这样真的好吗？明明还没正式接下……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_119_1057_p", "source_sha256": "cedc8c7fd759d99d54b5f714e67bb7b1874d97d1f683e9718b90f1da96deceb2", "ja": "先方がぜひにって。まあ、打診の時みたいに混乱\nするかもしれないから、無理にとは言わないけど……。", "zh": "对方坚持希望我们接下。虽然可能会像试探时那样陷入混乱，但也不会强求……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_119_1058_026yur", "source_sha256": "4ae0dc84643c6933326424a94479a7eb62aabeaf741170a0184c2b6bfbc15497", "ja": "うっ、確かにその可能性はあります……！\nでも、気になる……っ！　ううっ……！", "zh": "呜，确实有这种可能……！\n可是，我好在意……！唔唔……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_119_1059_p", "source_sha256": "e2e7962e0f5ef21f8728b39a966867089c42ffb801afbc3e9dba5da64f51e544", "ja": "はは、よかった。\n映画に、興味がないわけじゃないんだな。", "zh": "哈哈，那就好。\n看来你也不是对电影完全没兴趣啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_119_1060_026yur", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_119_1061_p", "source_sha256": "25f82c77bb624dae1167c9e5a5621237ef6027fccef908ff0efcefce03a6f6fd", "ja": "元々、百合子にとって思い入れのある作品なんだろ？\n色々と考えてしまうのは仕方がないと思う。", "zh": "本来就是百合子很有感情的作品吧？\n会不由得想很多，我觉得也是没办法的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_119_1062_p", "source_sha256": "e46e342e0dbcbb7a17c8825fdfca3f8726ba5ed4b2b395a25009de25576a0da7", "ja": "でも、絶対に受け入れられないとかじゃなくて……\nあくまで、緊張するというだけなんだなって。", "zh": "不过，并不是说绝对无法接受……\n只是会紧张而已……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_119_1063_026yur", "source_sha256": "aa146991bf61174cac6f5ac684f87d315e18166cc8a21f667096adb15f17aced", "ja": "あ……。それは、そう……ですね……。\n映画化に、絶対に反対とかではなくて……。", "zh": "啊……确实，是这样……呢……\n并不是绝对反对影视化……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_119_1064_026yur", "source_sha256": "1f9db9dc226a22dd0a76c1be49fc07fe3c982229ed7114b79c4962b4316126d8", "ja": "大好きな作品だから、\n私が関わるのが恐れ多くって……。", "zh": "正因为是我非常喜欢的作品，\n我才会觉得由我来参与实在太惶恐了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_119_1065_026yur", "source_sha256": "f22f1f7651547404bf5da5802eb2164e6acd80f42609304b0f9cd2c2a360445e", "ja": "大役を任されたことを、上手に受け止められないと\nいうか……きっと、そうなんだと思います。", "zh": "大概是因为被委以重任，自己却不知该如何去坦然面对\n……我想，一定就是这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_119_1066_p", "source_sha256": "ced5ea7f5254c9e42da45e81a880db9f1e7b1ece8d9d12041553e1e80f73a1cc", "ja": "そうか。\nそれがわかっただけでも、一歩前進だな。", "zh": "这样啊。能意识到这一点，就已经是向前迈进了一步。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_119_1067_026yur", "source_sha256": "0aec2dc3fc537383cd7ff284e6d56f098d8947e205ba2ff7ba7057a1e89f44e1", "ja": "はい。……あの、プロット、\n読んでみてもいいですか？", "zh": "好的。……那个，我可以读一下剧情大纲吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_119_1068_p", "source_sha256": "de9d16234af1437e7c59b94b8101997b769e91b68df631dce234d1a678a70dc5", "ja": "もちろん。", "zh": "这是当然。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_119_1069_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_119_1070_026yur", "source_sha256": "97bbeae397dcf4a1e90ec5b5e819e8429425abdf5bc3dbe7448750842136f9b0", "ja": "なるほど……妖精の視点にすれば、\n鏡のお城もきれいにまとまるかも……。", "zh": "原来如此……如果换成妖精的视角，\n镜之城的故事或许也能更圆满……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_119_1071_026yur", "source_sha256": "33c6e00e774b2848b4c290937503600b48e16e2a46935cb9a81593a8e7aaf523", "ja": "妖精の心情は原作にもなかったから、\nそのフォローにもなっているし……すごい……。", "zh": "原作里也没有描写过妖精的心情，\n这样一来正好弥补了这一点……太厉害了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_119_1072_026yur", "source_sha256": "ab7d9812b90dc202b154fe4bd0407c91916ee5b7599a6b06b0341e41a8623a7a", "ja": "あの、とてもいい脚本だと思います。大胆ですけど、\nリスペクトの感じられるアレンジだって思います！", "zh": "那个，我觉得这是非常出色的剧本。虽然改编得很大胆，但能感受到其中的敬意，我觉得这样的改编很棒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_119_1073_p", "source_sha256": "a94d90d72f9ce23385262404165812f57e7e356d01850a8d5a78b03e830cd087", "ja": "読み比べてみたけど、愛があるアレンジだと思う。\n真摯に取り組んでいることが伝わってくるよ。", "zh": "我对照着读了一遍，觉得这是融入了爱的改编。能感受到你一直在认真对待。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_119_1074_026yur", "source_sha256": "65b109bf682e11cb3804226129e0e990f24ac9c9d4156d64c5cecf0720d90178", "ja": "この脚本が素晴らしいことに違いありません。\nでも、その……。", "zh": "这个剧本一定很棒。\n但是，那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_119_1075_026yur", "source_sha256": "9c80db49b71c32cd301dac257c32091954bf6c8627ae1c1e821fa9bd4bb48cbc", "ja": "どうして、そんなに信じられるんでしょうか……。\n怖くないんでしょうか……。", "zh": "为什么能那么相信呢……  \n不会害怕吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_119_1076_026yur", "source_sha256": "9a165061b1f039cbeb7e24785cbfb8dd3f329d121bddf77b276f0fe665645ecb", "ja": "もし、ファンの人たちに\n認めてもらえなかったらって……。", "zh": "要是得不到粉丝们的\n认可该怎么办……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_119_1077_p", "source_sha256": "5c856b1c47ab462299133ec1d42faf22d7faa168f6f0b650ebbf0a9f613e1554", "ja": "そうだな……。\nもちろん制作陣も不安は抱えていると思う。", "zh": "是啊……\n当然制作团队应该也会感到不安。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_119_1078_p", "source_sha256": "21ec85000796bdd14f87309ddda6e91af9591181bbc157fd892510e3335a44d3", "ja": "でも、ファンの人達に届けるのと同じくらい、\nまだファンじゃない人にも届けたいんだと思うよ。", "zh": "不过，我想这和传达给粉丝们同样重要，也要传达给那些还不是粉丝的人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_119_1079_026yur", "source_sha256": "4e0718e4dcd198fd4c772067fb6f9a3a6b53a45139efaf531bfac0266b5b7fbf", "ja": "まだファンじゃない人……ですか？", "zh": "还不是粉丝的人……吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_119_1080_p", "source_sha256": "2a63b2dfcdfd3ffe078e6c256271ce51e370ca61d9340d4f41ddaf419b7382b2", "ja": "うん。メディアミックスの目的は、\n新しいファンを獲得することでもあると思う。", "zh": "嗯。我认为跨媒体制作的目的，\n也包括获得新的粉丝。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_119_1081_p", "source_sha256": "926ad3004519056a797246c06f8fa83b7830f2b78b7365bfa6cc1a2956cb9d48", "ja": "これなら、原作を知らなくても必ず伝わるものがある。\n信じてるんじゃないかな。原作の魅力を。", "zh": "这样的话，就算不了解原作，也一定有能传达给他们的东西。\n我想，他们是相信这一点的吧。相信原作的魅力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_119_1082_p", "source_sha256": "15149a31df5ed4e6866154cb6a1d5e9ef187496f176a95692a03766a47b7116c", "ja": "もちろん、百合子の力もな！", "zh": "当然，还有百合子的力量！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_119_1083_026yur", "source_sha256": "8600981bbf1357b1d93a59be87f4ad8a78429eef250317bebef62982f1622961", "ja": "え！？　わ、私の力ですか……？", "zh": "诶！？我、我的力量吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_119_1084_p", "source_sha256": "4b94aefa7806a22dddb16542ec42323b3087025ac02b584eac26a5331235aa6b", "ja": "言っただろう？　百合子のコラムを読んで、\nオファーをくれたって。", "zh": "我说过的吧？读了百合子的专栏，才来发出邀约的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_119_1085_026yur", "source_sha256": "88048e60b309dc9545d7b74ea04f8995a5f3b93b765065440af41469f11ba444", "ja": "そっか……。\n私のコラムを読んでくれたのが、はじまり……。", "zh": "这样啊……。\n原来是从有人读了我的专栏开始的……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_119_1086_026yur", "source_sha256": "e6da1f55ddac2456102df561d75bc61e180c4b4063a3f983c0ca8e11defbfe3c", "ja": "私が『好き』と言ったから\n始まったお仕事、なんですね……。……。", "zh": "因为我说了\"喜欢\"，\n才开始了这份工作呢……。……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_119_1087_p", "source_sha256": "b68f0974184f3c227aea1dbf6fcceb65eca82673a219d95ce483fc944a720ac1", "ja": "ああ。前に言っただろ？　百合子には、\n物語を届ける力があるって。", "zh": "对。之前不是说过吗？百合子有着将故事传递给大家的力量。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_119_1088_026yur", "source_sha256": "16a9f94fcf2db3dd463147da8e75325882292d347eac3fab2ea58d55068891b3", "ja": "あっ。\nそ、そうでした。私は……。", "zh": "啊。\n是、是的呢。我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_119_1089_026yur", "source_sha256": "be9eb9d38f1fd598558257650c2fac748975e561d8c06ff5faed9712bae231da", "ja": "アイドルになって……\n物語の、伝道師になりたいって……最初に……。", "zh": "成为偶像……\n成为故事的传播者……这是我最初的愿望……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_119_1090_p", "source_sha256": "fb0ee4ba12d125764f5f9c1cc215d982b24364a7f4e6c20afb297f4e849cc259", "ja": "プロットと一緒に、曲のデモも届いてるんだ。\nこれを聞いてから返事を考えても……。", "zh": "和剧情大纲一起，歌曲的小样也送来了。\n听完这个之后再考虑回复也……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_119_1091_026yur", "source_sha256": "7617e44e330d7763c81eff1197c09ce6dd27f6270e92491f0ea862cca9942f64", "ja": "{$P$}さん……大丈夫です！\nお返事はもう、決めましたから。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……没关系！\n我已经决定好回复了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_119_1092_p", "source_sha256": "23093cfb2c42f4347934e33568d4ff6e1c0fc89d064438070f23bc68ac787601", "ja": "そうか。心が決まったんだな。", "zh": "这样啊。你已经下定决心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_119_1093_026yur", "source_sha256": "347ab0e94c9de1f5728c3b753b2a9f3f5cfa21473c4a48863464f8d02c96d7b6", "ja": "はい！　……私、歌います！\nこの物語の歌……風の戦士の歌を……！", "zh": "是的！……我要歌唱！\n这段故事的歌……风之战士之歌……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
